From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Felipe Paiva <felipe.paiva@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 11:21:28 +0400
Subject: [PATCH] lynx-carts

Lynx games are flat cards, so the shelf draws a generated card: a
black plastic body with a ridged lip at the top, a groove under it and
the contact edge at the bottom, the label in a well over most of the
front, seated 240x148. Its neutral is generated by retro_neutrals like
every other shell; the disc keeps its own fixed seed, so every other
neutral is rebuilt byte for byte. The card follows nelynes/slotPlus
98419f4 (GPL-3.0), https://github.com/nelynes/slotPlus/commit/98419f4
---
 crates/slot-ui/assets/lynx_cart.svg          |   3 +++
 crates/slot-ui/assets/lynx_cart_detail.svg   |  21 +++++++++++++++++++
 crates/slot-ui/assets/retro/lynx_neutral.png | Bin 0 -> 114836 bytes
 crates/slot-ui/examples/retro_neutrals.rs    |   7 ++++++-
 crates/slot-ui/src/cart.rs                   |  10 +++++----
 crates/slot-ui/src/lib.rs                    |   4 ++--
 crates/slot-ui/src/retro_cart.rs             |  21 ++++++++++++++-----
 crates/slot-ui/src/retro_face.rs             |   4 +++-
 crates/slot-ui/src/retro_shell.rs            |   3 +++
 crates/slot-ui/src/shell.rs                  |   4 ++--
 crates/slot-ui/tests/render_nes_shelves.rs   |   5 ++++-
 crates/slot-ui/tests/retro_bitmap.rs         |   8 +++++--
 12 files changed, 72 insertions(+), 18 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 crates/slot-ui/assets/lynx_cart.svg
 create mode 100644 crates/slot-ui/assets/lynx_cart_detail.svg
 create mode 100644 crates/slot-ui/assets/retro/lynx_neutral.png

